  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0089_a9fe56b1afe0.png\" style=\"width: 355px; height: 150px;\" /></p><p>Mid point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi>AB</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>Perpendicular bisector of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>AB</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math>&nbsp;be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mn>2</mn>